msgstr "<p><b>P2P 多人联机解决方案</b></p>"

#: YukariConnectPage.cpp:287
msgid "<p>YukariConnect is a P2P multiplayer solution for Minecraft that allows players to connect without port forwarding or central servers.</p>"
msgstr "<p>YukariConnect 是一款面向 Minecraft 的 P2P 多人联机解决方案，允许玩家无需端口映射或中心服务器即可连接。</p>"

