msgid "Show licensing and attribution information for Terracotta"
msgstr "显示 Terracotta 的许可和归属信息"

msgctxt "TerracottaPage"
msgid "Select the download source for Terracotta:"
msgstr "选择 Terracotta 的下载源："

msgctxt "TerracottaPage"
msgid "Stop Terracotta when launcher closes"
msgstr "启动器关闭时停止 Terracotta"

msgctxt "TerracottaPage"
msgid "If enabled, the Terracotta server will be stopped when you close the launcher. If disabled, it will continue running in the background."
msgstr "启用后，关闭启动器时会停止 Terracotta 服务器。禁用后，它将继续在后台运行。"

msgctxt "TerracottaPage"
msgid "Use the Online menu in the main window to manage rooms and connections."
msgstr "使用主窗口中的「联机」菜单管理房间和连接。"

